      "korean": "응, 괜찮아. 무슨 일이야?",
      "romanization": "eung, gwaenchana. museun iriya?",
      "meaning": "Yeah, it's fine. What's up?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "korean": "그냥 목소리 듣고 싶었어요.",
      "romanization": "geunyang moksori deutgo sipeosseoyo.",
      "meaning": "I just wanted to hear your voice."
